  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "Right, so. He was sick in the night, Tuesday, no, Wednesday, it was bin day so Wednesday, and he's been sick three times. And then this morning the runs started.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:36",
      "end_timestamp": "00:52",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So vomiting since Wednesday night, and diarrhoea since this morning?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:53",
      "end_timestamp": "00:59",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "Yes. Well, the diarrhoea, it was before breakfast. Four times already today. Which is a lot for one small person.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:02",
      "end_timestamp": "01:12",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That helps me, thank you. Has Callum got any health problems I should know about?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:14",
      "end_timestamp": "02:23",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "He has asthma, mild, he's got the brown inhaler for it. Well, he had it, I'm not sure where it went.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:25",
      "end_timestamp": "02:37",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Temperature 37.6, so just slightly raised, and his pulse is 108, which is normal for a four-year-old who's been vomiting.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:16",
      "end_timestamp": "03:26",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "His belly is soft, and he's not tender anywhere. There's nothing that worries me.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:05",
      "end_timestamp": "04:13",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Together with the nursery and his brother, this looks like a tummy bug, gastroenteritis.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:20",
      "end_timestamp": "04:28",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "No, they don't help with a stomach bug. What helps is fluids, a little and often. A few sips every few minutes rather than a big glass.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:37",
      "end_timestamp": "04:49",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Most children are right within three to five days. If the diarrhoea is still going after a week, I'd like you to bring in a stool sample so we can test it.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:13",
      "end_timestamp": "05:29",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "If he's not weeing for eight hours, is very drowsy, vomits green, or has blood in the poo, take him to the emergency department.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:47",
      "end_timestamp": "06:00",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    }
